<element><id>UMLSequenceAllInOne</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>20</y><w>1875</w><h>879</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>title:SD6 AI Chatbox with agent tool use (F06)
obj=User~u
obj=ChatGUI~g
obj=AIController~c
obj=ChatAI~ai
obj=AgentMemory~m
obj=AIServiceProxy~px
obj=ChatGPTAdapter~ad
obj=ChatGPT5API~api
obj=ToolRegistry~tr
obj=GetFinancialDataTool~tool
obj=FinancialDataFacade~f
u-&gt;g: submitQuestion(text)
g-&gt;c: askQuestion(text)
c-&gt;ai: processQuestion(text)
ai-&gt;m: recall(userId)
m--&gt;ai: past messages and preferences
ai-&gt;ai: run() and buildPrompt(text)
ai-&gt;px: generateResponse(request)
px-&gt;px: checkAccess() and rate limit
px-&gt;ad: generateResponse(request)
ad-&gt;api: chatCompletion(payload)
api--&gt;ad: raw response with tool call
ad--&gt;px: AIResponse with tool call
px--&gt;ai: AIResponse with tool call
ai-&gt;tr: execute(get_financial_data, args)
tr-&gt;tool: execute(args)
tool-&gt;f: getFinancialData(userId)
f--&gt;tool: FinancialData
tool--&gt;tr: ToolResult
tr--&gt;ai: ToolResult
ai-&gt;m: add(observation)
ai-&gt;px: generateResponse(request + ToolResult)
px--&gt;ai: AIResponse with final answer
ai-&gt;ai: parseResult(response)
ai-&gt;m: add(answer)
ai--&gt;c: answer
c--&gt;g: displayResponse(answer)
g--&gt;u: answer shown
</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
<element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>929</y><w>1875</w><h>126</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Notes
- The loop (generateResponse, tool call, observe) repeats until the model gives a final answer or maxSteps is reached.
Alternative flows
- AI unavailable or too slow: user is told to try again in a few minutes.
- Proxy rejects the request (access or rate limit): same message.
- Unusable response: user is told a response could not be generated.</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
</diagram>
